            "identifier": [],
            "displayLabel": "Preferred Citation",
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Bawazir, A. S., Luthy, R., King, J. P., Tanzy, B. F., & Solis, J. (2014). Assessment of the crop coefficient for saltgrass under native riparian field conditions in the desert southwest. Hydrological Processes, 28(25), 6163-6171. http://doi.org/10.1002/hyp.10100",
